{
  "_comment": [
    "Routing configuration. Edit this, then re-run tools/fetch-route.py.",
    "",
    "waypoints  ordered list the router must pass through. 'via' entries are",
    "           shaping points only - they force the path onto a particular",
    "           road and never appear as markers. Non-via entries correspond",
    "           to ROUTE.stops. Reorder, insert or delete freely.",
    "radius_m   how far the router may snap a waypoint to find a road. Small",
    "           values keep a point pinned to the exact carriageway; too small",
    "           and the request fails with NoSegment. null = router default.",
    "",
    "Changing tolerance_m alone does NOT need a refetch - run",
    "tools/route-from-track.py on the cached raw geometry instead."
  ],

  "router": {
    "base_url": "https://router.project-osrm.org",
    "profile": "driving",
    "continue_straight": false
  },

  "tolerance_m": 12,
  "raw_output": "tools/route.raw.geojson",

